==Description==
The '''Blizzard Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 11 of the premium [[Operation I.C.E Event#Operation I.C.E Event Battle Pass|Operation I.C.E Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it costed {{Bell|310}} or {{Robux|52}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{Bell|1,740}} or {{Robux|762}}.

The '''Blizzard Nametag''' has white text with a blue translucent outline. Behind the text there is a large blizzard. Multiple snowflakes also appear on the nametag.

